Easypay - Your mobile wallet for online payments in Ukraine.
Make money transfers from card to card, pay utility bills (gas, electricity and others), top up your mobile and internet, as well as pay for travel directly in the app. In just a few clicks, you can make any payments through the phone without queues and long waits. The Easypay payment service does not charge any hidden fees, so you don't have to worry about the extra expenses of your budget.

The main features of the Easypay app:
- functionality allows you to pay for more than 3000 services;
- quick registration in a couple of clicks;
- adding and using bank cards (MasterCard, Visa);
- convenient account search by EDRPOU, name or IBAN;
- search for the nearest terminal near you;

The mobile application has the ability to set up regular payments, which will allow you not to overstay the required date, which is important for repaying loans and paying utility bills. This function is configured by specifying a specific time. You need to configure it once - then the procedure will be performed automatically within the specified time. Thus, you will not forget about important payments and payments. All receipts are archived and sent to you by mail, so you always have access to the official confirmation of all operations performed. In case of violation of traffic rules, the fine issued to you can also be paid using Easypay. All paid traffic fines will also be displayed in the archive.

Using the list of your contacts, you can easily and quickly send money to the accounts of friends, relatives and friends.

Easy Pay guarantees the safety of your data and funds when performing any operation in the application, as it annually undergoes PCI DSS certification (certain verification from MasterCard and Visa, to protect personal data). All information about you is securely protected in accordance with international standards.

With the Easy Pay mobile application, all your payments and payments become easy!
After all, we act as your personal electronic wallet
